# The Numbers Game.

**Authors:** Thomas, Jeffrey

## Abstract
Presents National Endowment for the Humanities date since 1980 on enrollment in humanities programs at higher education level. Examines two- and four-year college student enrollment, numbers of bachelor and doctoral degrees earned, and percentages of graduates with philosophy doctorates employed as teachers. Depicts two-year colleges capturing 30 percent of undergraduate enrollments in l988. (CH)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ422043

